    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Unit weight of the copper branch pipe to each unit, w_copper (kg/m). Default DN15 ≈ 0.42 kg/m per ASTM B88-22 Type L \citep{astmB88}. Since only one diameter is used for branch piping, the previous "diameter factor ≈ 1.0" was a redundant no-op and has been removed from the calculation chain.</rdfs:comment>
